{"id":"bf89ebe6b026d89d","group":"58","path":"58/batch01/58-df-total-variation.md","title":"Total Variation","display":"df-total-variation — Total Variation","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-total-variation","aliases":["58-df-total-variation","Total Variation","58-df-zfc-measure5-total-variation-measure","58-df-zfc-measure6-total-variation"],"display":"df-total-variation — Total Variation","depends_on":["[[../batch10/58-df-signed-measure.md]]","[[../batch13/58-df-measure.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-total-variation"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-total-variation</span><span>Total Variation</span><span>58-df-zfc-measure5-total-variation-measure</span><span>58-df-zfc-measure6-total-variation</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-total-variation — Total Variation"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"dd3d9d6492d2dd8b\" href=\"?note=dd3d9d6492d2dd8b\" title=\"../batch10/58-df-signed-measure.md\">../batch10/58-df-signed-measure.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"ca832ed6bc22f728\" href=\"?note=ca832ed6bc22f728\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-measure.md\">../batch13/58-df-measure.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v,\\mu,X,\\mathcal F\\in V\">\\(v,\\mu,X,\\mathcal F\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SignedMeasure}_S\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{SignedMeasure}_S\\subseteq V^3\\)</span> (signed-measure predicate with carrier and sigma-algebra; see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"dd3d9d6492d2dd8b\" href=\"?note=dd3d9d6492d2dd8b\" title=\"../batch10/58-df-signed-measure.md\">../batch10/58-df-signed-measure.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Measure}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Measure}_S\\)</span> (measure predicate; see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"ca832ed6bc22f728\" href=\"?note=ca832ed6bc22f728\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-measure.md\">../batch13/58-df-measure.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Function}\">\\(\\operatorname{Function}\\)</span> (function predicate; see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TotalVariationMeasure}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{TotalVariationMeasure}_S\\)</span> (total-variation-measure relation defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}total\\text{-}variation} \\vdash \\mathrm{TotalVariationMeasure}_S(v,\\mu,X,\\mathcal F)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{SignedMeasure}_S(\\mu,X,\\mathcal F)\\land \\mathrm{Measure}_S(v,X,\\mathcal F)\\land \\forall E\\in\\mathcal F\\;\\left(v(E)=\\sup\\left\\{\\sum_{i\\in n}|\\mu(P(i))|\\,\\middle|\\,n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\land \\operatorname{Function}(P,n,\\mathcal F)\\land E=\\bigcup_{i\\in n}P(i)\\land \\forall i,j\\in n\\;(i\\neq j\\to P(i)\\cap P(j)=\\varnothing)\\right\\}\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}total\\text{-}variation} \\vdash \\mathrm{TotalVariationMeasure}_S(v,\\mu,X,\\mathcal F)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{SignedMeasure}_S(\\mu,X,\\mathcal F)\\land \\mathrm{Measure}_S(v,X,\\mathcal F)\\land \\forall E\\in\\mathcal F\\;\\left(v(E)=\\sup\\left\\{\\sum_{i\\in n}|\\mu(P(i))|\\,\\middle|\\,n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\land \\operatorname{Function}(P,n,\\mathcal F)\\land E=\\bigcup_{i\\in n}P(i)\\land \\forall i,j\\in n\\;(i\\neq j\\to P(i)\\cap P(j)=\\varnothing)\\right\\}\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The total-variation norm of a finite signed measure is <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\|\\mu\\|_{\\mathrm{TV}}=v(X)\">\\(\\|\\mu\\|_{\\mathrm{TV}}=v(X)\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>In the polar decomposition, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d\\mu=h\\,dv\">\\(d\\mu=h\\,dv\\)</span> with <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|h|=1\">\\(|h|=1\\)</span> almost everywhere.</li>\n<li>For probability measures, the convention <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d_{\\mathrm{TV}}(P,Q)=\\sup_A|P(A)-Q(A)|\">\\(d_{\\mathrm{TV}}(P,Q)=\\sup_A|P(A)-Q(A)|\\)</span> equals one half of the variation norm of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P-Q\">\\(P-Q\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Rudin, Real and Complex Analysis</li>\n<li>Billingsley, Probability and Measure</li>\n<li>Dudley, Real Analysis and Probability</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch10/58-df-signed-measure.md","status":"resolved","id":"dd3d9d6492d2dd8b","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch10/58-df-signed-measure.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch13/58-df-measure.md","status":"resolved","id":"ca832ed6bc22f728","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch13/58-df-measure.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch10/58-df-signed-measure.md","status":"resolved","id":"dd3d9d6492d2dd8b","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{SignedMeasure}_S\\subseteq V^3$ (signed-measure predicate with carrier and sigma-algebra; see [[../batch10/58-df-signed-measure.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch13/58-df-measure.md","status":"resolved","id":"ca832ed6bc22f728","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Measure}_S$ (measure predicate; see [[../batch13/58-df-measure.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Function}$ (function predicate; see [[../batch16/58-df-function.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"v,\\mu,X,\\mathcal F\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SignedMeasure}_S\\subseteq V^3","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Measure}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Function}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{TotalVariationMeasure}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}total\\text{-}variation} \\vdash \\mathrm{TotalVariationMeasure}_S(v,\\mu,X,\\mathcal F)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{SignedMeasure}_S(\\mu,X,\\mathcal F)\\land \\mathrm{Measure}_S(v,X,\\mathcal F)\\land \\forall E\\in\\mathcal F\\;\\left(v(E)=\\sup\\left\\{\\sum_{i\\in n}|\\mu(P(i))|\\,\\middle|\\,n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\land \\operatorname{Function}(P,n,\\mathcal F)\\land E=\\bigcup_{i\\in n}P(i)\\land \\forall i,j\\in n\\;(i\\neq j\\to P(i)\\cap P(j)=\\varnothing)\\right\\}\\right)","display":true},{"tex":"\\|\\mu\\|_{\\mathrm{TV}}=v(X)","display":false},{"tex":"d\\mu=h\\,dv","display":false},{"tex":"|h|=1","display":false},{"tex":"d_{\\mathrm{TV}}(P,Q)=\\sup_A|P(A)-Q(A)|","display":false},{"tex":"P-Q","display":false}],"bytes":1840,"backlinks":[{"id":"71806da6139ee022","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{TotalVariationMeasure}_S\\subseteq V^4$ (total-variation relation, see [[../batch01/58-df-total-variation.md]])"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1307","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch01/58-df-total-variation.md|58-df-total-variation]]（batch01）"}],"outgoing":["dd3d9d6492d2dd8b","ca832ed6bc22f728","36d7463d215be751"]}